Package: a-nas-montage-music
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: all
Maintainer: A-NAS <zhongwater123@users.noreply.github.com>
Section: misc
Priority: optional
Depends: a-nas (= @VERSION@), @CONTENT@
Description: the montage center's music analysis for A-NAS
 allin1 finds a song's beats, downbeats and sections for the montage center
 (docs/architecture/montage-music.md): its Worker, units and the links to
 its runtime and models, which are content packages of their own. While
 allin1's commercial licence is pending it is installed by hand on the
 development machine and the Experimental NAS only, and no release depends
 on it (docs/runbooks/enable-montage-music.md).
